      "cr": 0.5,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — The Mushroom Room Guard.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 1/2 as a soldier. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>Field Observations</strong> — Household of the Overgrown Manor</p><p>Status: Active - eyes bloodshot; insists he is unaffected</p><p>A house guard who maintains that the mushroom room had no effect on him whatsoever, and who was missing for a stretch of time he accounts for as field observations. His eyes are bloodshot. The mushrooms, when picked up and sniffed, are fine.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Spear</strong> — “Field Observations”</li><li><strong>As Filed</strong> — “Field Observations”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/the_mushroom_room_guard</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/the_mushroom_room_guard</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
